# Secret Research Project

Project Name: **Orion-47**

The Orion-47 project was started in **2024** by a team called **Nova Labs**.

The project uses a custom algorithm called **BlueFox**.

The main objective of Orion-47 is to improve **robot navigation in indoor environments**.

The project has **17 active researchers**.

The project headquarters is located in **Kathmandu, Nepal**.

The current project manager is **Arjun Mehta**.

The project's internal testing robot is named **Rover-X9**.
